<title>USA: Act Networks cuts deal with Comsat unit.</title>
<headline>Act Networks cuts deal with Comsat unit.</headline>
<dateline>CAMARILLO, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACT Networks Inc said Friday it has signed a worlwide reseller agreement with Comsat International, a unit of Comsat Corp, under which Comsat will use ACT's frame-relay access products to build private satellite networks in Brazil.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were undisclosed.</p>
</text>
